# The samples of the AI-reading measurement: the author's handwriting, with the time and pressure
# of every stroke. They stay out of git; agents may open them, but nothing of them comes into the
# repository, as CLAUDE.md says.
/samples/

# What code draws — sheets, their pictures and splits — and the runs on them: no handwriting. They
# stay out of git too, and agents work with them, as CLAUDE.md says.
/synthetic/

# What release-files writes, for .github's shared release to sign and publish.
/dist/

# The coverage of the tests that ci-test writes, which CI sends to Codecov.
/coverage/
